  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Oh—you’re <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, yes?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nDo you remember me? I’m the representative of\nthe Lumiose Safety Group. My name’s Gardie.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 118
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I wish we’d met under better circumstances. It\nwasn’t exactly decorous to surround the CEO of<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nQuasartico Inc. and pelt accusations at her.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On behalf of our group, please accept my most\nsincere apologies!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E00200062006500680061006C00660020006F00660020006F00750072002000670072006F00750070002C00200070006C006500610073006500200061006300630065007000740020006D00790020006D006F00730074000A00730069006E0063006500720065002000610070006F006C006F0067006900650073002100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We can’t protect Lumiose’s integrity and manners\nif we can’t maintain our own, after all.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The peace and calm of our city’s citizens is the\nLumiose Safety Group’s North Star!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Unfortunately, that peace and calm is now under\nthreat once more.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThere’s a popular account online called the Hex\nManiac Channel that’s been sharing videos about<U+0010><U+0001>븀\noccult phenomena.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 190
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alas, their content has stirred discontent in our\nfair city!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C00610073002C00200074006800650069007200200063006F006E00740065006E007400200068006100730020007300740069007200720065006400200064006900730063006F006E00740065006E007400200069006E0020006F00750072000A006600610069007200200063006900740079002100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And no wonder—they make terrifying claims!\nFor example, they say there’s a ghostly woman<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhaunting a building on North Boulevard!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 136
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If they’re spreading misinformation, then they’ll\nbe hearing from us—in no uncertain terms!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We just need to catch them peddling a baseless\nrumor. For that, we need you to investigate one of<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ntheir posts, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 124
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Here’s a recent post of theirs. This should give\nyou a lead to follow.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "“At the hour when the grandest shadow’s tip\npierces the center of the circle of red and white...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“they who dare thrust their fist toward the earth\nmay find a ghostly child creeping near.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“Is this true? Find out for yourself, if you dare...\nTruth is in the eye of the beholder.”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 288
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There you have it. Could they be telling the truth,\nor are they making it all up for the clout?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPlease look into it for us. I’m sure you can do it!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 3268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 155
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please find out if what the Hex Maniac Channel\nposted is true. Here’s what they said:<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“At the hour when the grandest shadow’s tip\npierces the center of the circle of red and white...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“they who dare thrust their fist toward the earth\nmay find a ghostly child creeping near.”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 3580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 284
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 4148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You have a feeling this is the spot the Hex Maniac\nChannel mentioned, but something’s not right...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 4160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The tower’s shadow is falling across the spot that\nthe Hex Maniac Channel mentioned.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 4360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Will you thrust your fist toward the earth?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 4532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570069006C006C00200079006F0075002000740068007200750073007400200079006F007500720020006600690073007400200074006F00770061007200640020007400680065002000650061007200740068003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ground, meet fist!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 4620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470072006F0075006E0064002C0020006D0065006500740020006600690073007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nah, sounds painful",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 4660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E00610068002C00200073006F0075006E006400730020007000610069006E00660075006C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aha—I’ve made it in time! Let’s see together\nwhether this ghost story is true!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 4700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Is...is this that “ghostly child”?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 4868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490073002E002E002E0069007300200074006800690073002000740068006100740020201C00670068006F00730074006C00790020006300680069006C0064201D003F002100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Catch it! That’s the only way we can know for sure\nwhether the story was true!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 4948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 5116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, no, no! You’ve got to catch it!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 5128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002C0020006E006F002C0020006E006F002100200059006F007520190076006500200067006F007400200074006F002000630061007400630068002000690074002100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 5208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fascinating.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 5220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460061007300630069006E006100740069006E0067002E00100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So this is what the Hex Maniac Channel was\nreferring to.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 5256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F0020007400680069007300200069007300200077006800610074002000740068006500200048006500780020004D0061006E0069006100630020004300680061006E006E0065006C0020007700610073000A0072006500660065007200720069006E006700200074006F002E00100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Which means...they’re not spreading baseless\nrumors.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 5380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680069006300680020006D00650061006E0073002E002E002E00740068006500792019007200650020006E006F007400200073007000720065006100640069006E006700200062006100730065006C006500730073000A00720075006D006F00720073002E00100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I suppose I’ll report to the rest of the group that\nthis channel’s not fraudulent after all.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 5496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you for your assistance!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 5692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061006E006B00200079006F007500200066006F007200200079006F0075007200200061007300730069007300740061006E00630065002100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Could this mean...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 5764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F0075006C0064002000740068006900730020006D00650061006E002E002E002E00100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There really IS a ghostly woman haunting that\nbuilding on North Boulevard?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Given how well you protected the city during that\nincident with the tower, we could really use you<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nin the Lumiose Safety Group!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    }
